==== spine 1 (OEBPS/chapter2.xhtml) ====
Chapter Two: A Continuation
This chapter exists so the spine has more than one entry, so locators can point past spine index zero, and so forced page breaks have somewhere to land.
Part the Second
An anchor above should appear in the anchors map when layout runs. Unicode coverage: naïve café — em-dash, “curly quotes”, and the ligature-friendly word affluence.
This paragraph requests a page break before itself via the legacy page-break-before property.
